.TH HTTP_GET 3
.SH NAME
http_get \- initiate an HTTP GET request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "int http_get(http* " h ", const char* " location ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR http_get ()
initializes an HTTP GET request to the specified
.IR location .
It handles host resolution, sets up request structures, and initiates the
connection process.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 1 on success, 0 on failure.